{"slug":"/references/fulfillment/listShippingOptionTypes","title":"listShippingOptionTypes - Fulfillment Module Reference","frontmatter":{"displayed_sidebar":"fulfillmentReference","slug":"/references/fulfillment/listShippingOptionTypes","sidebar_label":"listShippingOptionTypes"},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"listshippingoptiontypes-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"listshippingoptiontypes-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This documentation provides a reference to the `listShippingOptionTypes` method. This belongs to the Fulfillment Module."},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You should only use this methods when implementing complex customizations. For common cases, check out [available workflows instead](/medusa-workflows-reference)."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method retrieves a paginated list of shipping option types based on optional filters and configuration."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"To retrieve a list of shipping option types using their IDs:\n\n```ts\nconst shippingOptionTypes =\n  await fulfillmentModuleService.listShippingOptionTypes({\n    id: [\"sotype_123\", \"sotype_321\"],\n  })\n```\n\nTo specify relations that should be retrieved within the shipping option type:"},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You can only retrieve data models defined in the same module. To retrieve linked data models\nfrom other modules, use [Query](https://docs.medusajs.com/learn/fundamentals/module-links/query) instead."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nconst shippingOptionTypes =\n  await fulfillmentModuleService.listShippingOptionTypes(\n    {\n      id: [\"sotype_123\", \"sotype_321\"],\n    },\n    {\n      relations: [\"shipping_option\"],\n    }\n  )\n```\n\nBy default, only the first `15` records are retrieved. You can control pagination by specifying the `skip` and `take` properties of the `config` parameter:\n\n```ts\nconst shippingOptionTypes =\n  await fulfillmentModuleService.listShippingOptionTypes(\n    {\n      id: [\"sotype_123\", \"sotype_321\"],\n    },\n    {\n      relations: [\"shipping_option\"],\n      take: 20,\n      skip: 2,\n    }\n  )\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"listshippingoptiontypes-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"listShippingOptionTypes","types":[{"name":"filters","type":"[FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps)","description":"The filters to apply on the retrieved shipping option types.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"$and","type":"([FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.BaseFilterable)&#60;[FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps)&#62;)[]","description":"An array of filters to apply on the entity, where each item in the array is joined with an \"and\" condition.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"$and","type":"([FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.BaseFilterable)&#60;[FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps)&#62;)[]","description":"An array of filters to apply on the entity, where each item in the array is joined with an \"and\" condition.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"$or","type":"([FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps](/references/fulfillment/interfaces/fulfillment.FilterableShippingOptionTypeProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/fulfillmen